<div><strong><em>Copula</em></strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div>Something is something else</div>
    <div>noun + <strong>shì</strong> + noun</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">X是Y</div>
    <div>X shì Y</div>
    <div>X is Y</div>
</div>
<div><strong><em>Relative</em></strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div>Subordinate clause that modifies a noun phrase</div>
    <div>verb-le + object<em>(referent)</em>-<strong>de</strong><em>(relative pronoun)</em> + subject<em>(antecedent)</em></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">喝<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">了</span>牛奶<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">的</span>猫</div>
    <div>hē le niúnǎi de māo</div>
    <div>The cat that/who drank the milk</div>
</div>
<div><strong><em>Conditional</em></strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div>Subordinate clause that expresses a requirement</div>
    <div><strong>yàoshi</strong> + subject + verb + object + <strong>jiù</strong> + subject + verb + object</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">要是</span>猫走进房间来,<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">就</span>他会喝牛奶</div>
    <div>yàoshi māo zǒu-jìn fángjiān lái, jiù tā huì hē niúnǎi</div>
    <div>If the cat enters the room then he will drink the milk</div>
    <div><strong>yàobù</strong> + subject + verb + object + <strong>jiù</strong> + subject + <strong>bù</strong> + verb + object</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms"><span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">要不</span>猫走进房间来,<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">就</span>他<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">不</span>会喝牛奶</div>
    <div>yàobù māo zǒu-jìn fángjiān lái, jiù tā bù huì hē niúnǎi</div>
    <div>If the cat does not enter the room then he will not drink the milk</div>
</div>
